{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["呼召以色列悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若回來歸向我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若從我眼前除掉你可憎的偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就不被遷移。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必憑誠實、公平、公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指着永生的耶和華起誓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國必因耶和華稱自己為有福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必因他誇耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華對猶大和耶路撒冷人如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要開墾你們的荒地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要撒種在荊棘中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大人和耶路撒冷的居民哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當自行割禮，歸耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將心裏的污穢除掉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怕我的忿怒因你們的惡行發作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如火着起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至無人能以熄滅！","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["外患威脅猶大"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"你們當傳揚在猶大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣告在耶路撒冷說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當在國中吹角，高聲呼叫說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當聚集！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好進入堅固城！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"應當向錫安豎立大旗。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要逃避，不要遲延，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我必使災禍與大毀滅從北方來到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有獅子從密林中上來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是毀壞列國的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠已經動身出離本處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使你的地荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的城邑變為荒場無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你們當腰束麻布，大聲哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的烈怒沒有向我們轉消。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華說：「到那時，君王和首領的心都要消滅；祭司都要驚奇，先知都要詫異。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我說：「哀哉！主耶和華啊，你真是大大地欺哄這百姓和耶路撒冷，說：『你們必得平安。』其實刀劍害及性命了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["那時，必有話對這百姓和耶路撒冷說：「有一陣熱風從曠野淨光的高處向我的眾民",{"noteId":4},"颳來，不是為簸揚，也不是為揚淨。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["必有一陣更大的風從這些地方為我颳來；現在我又必發出判語，攻擊他們。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["猶大被敵人圍困"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"看哪，仇敵必如雲上來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的戰車如旋風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的馬匹比鷹更快。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們敗落了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，你當洗去心中的惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你可以得救。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡念存在你心裏要到幾時呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有聲音從但傳揚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從以法蓮山報禍患。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當傳給列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報告攻擊耶路撒冷的事說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有探望的人從遠方來到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向猶大的城邑大聲吶喊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們周圍攻擊耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像看守田園的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她背叛了我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的行動，你的作為，招惹這事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是你罪惡的結果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"實在是苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是害及你心了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米為同胞擔憂"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"我的肺腑啊，我的肺腑啊，我心疼痛！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心在我裏面煩躁不安。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不能靜默不言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我已經聽見角聲和打仗的喊聲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀壞的信息連絡不絕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為全地荒廢。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的帳棚忽然毀壞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的幔子頃刻破裂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看見大旗，聽見角聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要到幾時呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：我的百姓愚頑，不認識我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們是愚昧無知的兒女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有智慧行惡，沒有知識行善。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米的異象－將要來臨的毀滅"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"先知說：我觀看地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不料，地是空虛混沌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我觀看天，天也無光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我觀看大山，不料，盡都震動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小山也都搖來搖去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我觀看，不料，無人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"空中的飛鳥也都躲避。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我觀看，不料，肥田變為荒地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一切城邑在耶和華面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他的烈怒都被拆毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華如此說：全地必然荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我卻不毀滅淨盡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，地要悲哀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在上的天也必黑暗；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我言已出，我意已定，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不後悔，也不轉意不做。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各城的人因馬兵和弓箭手的響聲就都逃跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"進入密林，爬上磐石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各城被撇下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人住在其中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你淒涼的時候要怎樣行呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你雖穿上朱紅衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"佩戴黃金裝飾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用顏料修飾眼目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣標緻是枉然的！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戀愛你的藐視你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且尋索你的性命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我聽見有聲音，彷彿婦人產難的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像生頭胎疼痛的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是錫安女子","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"的聲音；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她喘着氣、挓挲手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：我有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在殺人的跟前，我的心發昏了。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"原文是民女","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":11}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"就是指民的意思","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":31}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}